    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n71083" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νοσ-ώδης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sickly, ailing,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				7.67
			</span></i> (
				Comp.
			) ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ν.,</span> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ὑγιεινά,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				438e
			</span></i> ; of persons, ib.<i><span class="en">
				406a
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ν. σῶμα, βίος,</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				556e
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Lg.</u>
				734d
